lox init: /project

Prerequisites
  ok  Docker 29.0.0
  ok  cosign (lox add and lox run verify every image's signature)
  ok  lea
  ok  launchers: locksql, lockmq, lockfile, lockhttp

  found: postgres on host.docker.internal:55432 (compose.yaml, .env) → `lox add locksql`
  found: rabbitmq on http://host.docker.internal:55672 (compose.yaml) → `lox add lockmq`
  found: mysql on inventory.internal:3307 (config/inventory.yaml) → `lox add locksql`

lockfamily.yaml written: the hub alone

[lox up]

Ready. Run `lea` (or `claude` + `lox approve`). Add a source: `lox add locksql|lockmq|lockfile|lockhttp`.
